            "name": "Gorgon Terminator Armour",
            "description": "Iron Father and the Tartaros Praetor, Centurion, Warmonger, Librarian, Esoterist, Legion Champion, Chaplain, Herald, Siege Breaker, Forge Lord, Primus Medicae, Delegatus and Mortificator can have Gorgon Terminator Armour selected for them for +30 Points per Model. A Model with Gorgon Terminator Armour gains the Heavy Sub-Type and the Feel No Pain (5+) Special Rule and the Gorgon pattern Terminator Armour Wargear item.",
